{"id": "141282", "name": "מכפלה פנימית סטנדרטית ונורמה ב-R⁴", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "(", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "functions": [{"name": "randvervect", "params": ["n", "k"], "body": "transpose(makelist(rand_with_step(-k,k,1),n))"}, {"name": "vectToPoly", "params": ["vect"], "body": "block([poly:0], for i:0 thru (length(vect)-1) do(poly: poly + x^i*vect[i+1,1]),poly)"}, {"name": "polyToVect", "params": ["poly"], "body": "transpose(rest(coeff_list(x^n+poly,x),-1))"}, {"name": "prod", "params": ["u", "v"], "body": "u.v"}, {"name": "norm", "params": ["v"], "body": "sqrt(prod(v,v))"}, {"name": "sxneg", "params": ["x"], "body": "(numberp(x) and is(x<0)) or (not atom(x) and (op(x)=\"+\" or op(x)=\"-\" or (op(x)=\"*\" and numberp(first(args(x))) and is(first(args(x))<0))))"}, {"name": "sxp", "params": ["x"], "body": "if sxneg(x) then concat(\"\\\\left(\",tex1(x),\"\\\\right)\") else tex1(x)"}, {"name": "sxtmul", "params": ["e"], "body": "simplode(map(sxp, args(e)), \" \\\\cdot \")"}, {"name": "sxtsum", "params": ["e"], "body": "block([L:first(args(e))], concat(tex1(first(L)), apply(sconcat, map(lambda([t], concat(\"+\",tex1(t))), rest(L)))))"}, {"name": "sxtnsum", "params": ["e"], "body": "block([L:first(args(e))], concat(tex1(first(L)), apply(sconcat, map(lambda([t], if numberp(t) and is(t<0) then concat(\"-\",tex1(-t)) else if sxneg(t) then concat(\"+\",sxp(t)) else concat(\"+\",tex1(t))), rest(L)))))"}, {"name": "sxtsq", "params": ["e"], "body": "concat(sxp(first(args(e))), \"^2\")"}, {"name": "sxtsub", "params": ["e"], "body": "concat(tex1(first(args(e))), \"-\", sxp(second(args(e))))"}], "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">הנתונים</div><p>נתונים הוקטורים <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(u,v,w\\in\\mathbb{R}^4\\)</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\(u={{CT:0}}\\),&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\\(v={{CT:1}}\\),&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\\(w={{CT:2}}\\)</p></div><p>חשבו את הבאים, לפי המכפלה הפנימית הסטנדרטית של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathbb{R}^4\\)</span>:</p><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:26px;height:26px;line-height:26px;text-align:center;border-radius:50%;background:#4b1f6f;color:#fff;margin-left:8px\">א׳</span></div><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(\\langle u,v \\rangle&nbsp;=\\) [[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:26px;height:26px;line-height:26px;text-align:center;border-radius:50%;background:#4b1f6f;color:#fff;margin-left:8px\">ב׳</span></div><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(\\lVert w\\rVert=\\) [[input:ans2]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans2]]</div><p style=\"font-size:0.92em;margin:8px 0 0\">הערה: הדרך להזנת שורש <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:3}}\\)</span> היא <code dir=\"ltr\">sqrt(a)</code>.</p></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">מבנה הפתרון:</b> מציבים את הרכיבים בהגדרה של המכפלה הפנימית הסטנדרטית (סעיף א׳), ומחשבים את הנורמה כשורש של המכפלה הפנימית של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(w\\)</span> בעצמו (סעיף ב׳).</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 1 — סעיף א׳: המכפלה הפנימית <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\langle u,v\\rangle\\)</span></b><br>המכפלה הפנימית הסטנדרטית ב-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathbb{R}^4\\)</span> היא סכום המכפלות של הרכיבים המתאימים:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\langle u,v\\rangle=u_1v_1+u_2v_2+u_3v_3+u_4v_4 \\]</p>מציבים:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\langle u,v\\rangle={{CT:4}}={{CT:5}}={{CT:6}} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 2 — סעיף ב׳: הנורמה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\lVert w\\rVert\\)</span></b><br>הנורמה המושרית מהמכפלה הפנימית היא <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\lVert w\\rVert=\\sqrt{\\langle w,w\\rangle}\\)</span>, כלומר שורש סכום ריבועי הרכיבים:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\lVert w\\rVert=\\sqrt{{{CT:7}}}=\\sqrt{{{CT:8}}}=\\sqrt{{{CT:9}}}[[if test=\"{{CT:11}}\"]]={{CT:10}}[[/if]] \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]][[feedback:prt2]]", "prtcorrect": "", "prtpartiallycorrect": "", "prtincorrect": "", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 10, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 10, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "uvprod", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף א׳ — נכון.</b> הזנת את הערך הנכון עבור <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\langle u,v \\rangle \\)</span>.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף א׳ — שגוי.</b> הערך שהזנת עבור <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\langle u,v \\rangle \\)</span>הינו שגוי.</div>"}}]}, {"name": "prt2", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "nonnegative: is(ans2 >= 0)", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "nonnegative", "tans": "true", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "prt2-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-1-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף ב׳ — שגוי.</b> תשובתך אינה נכונה. הערך <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\lVert w\\rVert\\)</span> אינו יכול להיות שלילי!</div>"}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "expand(ans2)", "tans": "expand(wnorm)", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-2-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף ב׳ — נכון.</b> הזנת את הערך הנכון עבור <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\lVert w\\rVert\\)</span>.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "-", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-2-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף ב׳ — שגוי.</b> הערך שהזנת עבור <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\lVert w\\rVert\\)</span> הינו שגוי.</div>"}}]}], "qvnames": ["k", "n", "sxsf", "sxuv", "sxuvn", "sxw2", "sxww", "sxwwn", "u", "uvprod", "v", "w", "wnorm"], "nvariants": 50}